{"id":"f36fa03fda24ed88","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"原子公式","display":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["43-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式","depends_on":["[[43-df-term]]","[[43-df-first-order-language]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"961683c3b48a18ae\" href=\"?note=961683c3b48a18ae\" title=\"43-df-term\">43-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"809479f98d99c157\" href=\"?note=809479f98d99c157\" title=\"43-df-first-order-language\">43-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L\">\\(t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\">\\(R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n\\)</span>。项和语言签名采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"961683c3b48a18ae\" href=\"?note=961683c3b48a18ae\" title=\"43-df-term\">43-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"809479f98d99c157\" href=\"?note=809479f98d99c157\" title=\"43-df-first-order-language\">43-df-first-order-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\">\\(t=u\\)</span> 作为公式参数时表示下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)\\)</span>；元语言等号仍表示集合相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u):=(5,(t,u)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}(R,\\bar t):=(6,(R,\\bar t)),\\qquad(t=u):=\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u),\\qquad R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):=\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u):=(5,(t,u)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}(R,\\bar t):=(6,(R,\\bar t)),\\qquad(t=u):=\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u),\\qquad R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):=\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqFml}_L:=\\{\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u):(t,u)\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EqFml}_L:=\\{\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u):(t,u)\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelFml}_L:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\{\\operatorname{Rel}(R,\\bar t):R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\land\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RelFml}_L:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\{\\operatorname{Rel}(R,\\bar t):R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\land\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AtFml}_L:=\\operatorname{EqFml}_L\\cup\\operatorname{RelFml}_L,\\qquad\\operatorname{Atomic}_L(\\varphi)\\iff\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{AtFml}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AtFml}_L:=\\operatorname{EqFml}_L\\cup\\operatorname{RelFml}_L,\\qquad\\operatorname{Atomic}_L(\\varphi)\\iff\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{AtFml}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原子公式是带标签的语法对象，等式构造不与元语言的真值判断混同。不同标签保证等式原子和关系原子不重叠。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"961683c3b48a18ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"809479f98d99c157","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"961683c3b48a18ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$；$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n$。项和语言签名采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$t=u$ 作为公式参数时表示下式 $\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)$；元语言等号仍表示集合相等。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"809479f98d99c157","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$；$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n$。项和语言签名采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$t=u$ 作为公式参数时表示下式 $\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)$；元语言等号仍表示集合相等。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n","display":false},{"tex":"t=u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u):=(5,(t,u)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}(R,\\bar t):=(6,(R,\\bar t)),\\qquad(t=u):=\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u),\\qquad R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):=\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EqFml}_L:=\\{\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u):(t,u)\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RelFml}_L:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\{\\operatorname{Rel}(R,\\bar t):R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\land\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AtFml}_L:=\\operatorname{EqFml}_L\\cup\\operatorname{RelFml}_L,\\qquad\\operatorname{Atomic}_L(\\varphi)\\iff\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{AtFml}_L.","display":true}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a4ba10013f4fc82","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$；$x\\in\\operatorname{Var}$，$\\varphi,\\psi$ 为候选公式对象；$m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{AtFml}_L$ 采用 [[43-df-atomic-formula]]。对象层连接词与量词记法是下式编码的别名。"},{"id":"16154750d33f58cc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$x\\in\\operatorname{Var}$、$c\\in L_{\\rm Const}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$；$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L$。构造函数采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-atomic-formula]]、[[43-df-formula]]；以下沿有限语法树递归。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-488","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-atomic-formula]] — 原子公式"}],"outgoing":["961683c3b48a18ae","809479f98d99c157"]}